---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';import TagPicker from '../../components/TagPicker.astro';
---
<Base title="작성 / 내 작업" noindex><header class="compact-header"><span class="eyebrow">MY STUDIO</span><h1>오늘의 작업을 남겨보세요.</h1><p>새 작업을 작성하거나 저장한 초안과 공개 콘텐츠를 편집할 수 있습니다.</p></header><p class="cs-note" data-studio-status role="status">로그인 상태를 확인하고 있습니다.</p><div class="cs-actions"><a class="button secondary" href="/account/creator/">Creator 신청·상태</a><a class="button secondary" href="/space/write/">일반 게시글 쓰기</a></div>
<form class="cs-editor" data-editor><fieldset disabled data-editor-fields><label><span data-field-label="kind">종류</span><select name="kind"><option value="work">Work · 개인 작품</option><option value="project">Project · 팀 프로젝트</option><option value="teamup">Team Up · 팀원 모집</option><option value="event">Event · 행사</option></select></label><p class="kind-guide" data-kind-guide></p><div class="authoring-checklist"><strong data-kind-heading></strong><p data-kind-checklist></p></div><label><span data-field-label="title">제목</span><input name="title" required minlength="2" maxlength="100"/></label><label><span data-field-label="summary">짧은 소개</span><textarea name="summary" required minlength="10" maxlength="1500" rows="3"></textarea></label><label><span data-field-label="category">분야 / 찾는 직군 / 엔진</span><input name="category" list="category-options" required minlength="2" maxlength="80" placeholder="게임 기획 · Unity"/></label><datalist id="category-options"></datalist><label><span data-field-label="visibility">공개 범위</span><select name="visibility"><option value="draft">나만 보는 초안</option><option value="public">전체 공개</option><option value="members">회원에게 공개</option></select></label>
<div data-entry-fields class="kind-fields"><label><span data-field-label="body">본문</span><textarea name="body" rows="14" maxlength="30000" placeholder="작업 과정과 결과, 모집 조건 또는 행사 내용을 적어주세요."></textarea></label><TagPicker name="tags" label="작품 태그" suggestions={['게임 기획','게임 개발','액션','퍼즐','생성형 AI','2D','3D','게임잼','Unity']}/><label><span data-field-label="project_id">연결할 프로젝트</span><select name="project_id"><option value="">연결하지 않음</option></select></label><details><summary data-media-summary>대표 이미지·시연 영상</summary><label><span data-field-label="cover_url">대표 이미지 주소</span><input name="cover_url" type="url" placeholder="https://"/><small>이미지는 HTTPS 주소를 사용합니다. 파일 자료는 게시판에서 첨부하고 해당 글을 연결할 수 있습니다.</small></label><label><span data-field-label="cover_alt">이미지 설명</span><input name="cover_alt" maxlength="200"/></label><label><span data-field-label="video_url">플레이 영상 주소</span><input name="video_url" type="url" placeholder="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=..."/></label></details><label><span data-field-label="external_url">결과물 / 참가 신청 / 첨부 게시글 주소</span><input name="external_url" type="url" placeholder="https://"/></label><div class="form-row"><label><span data-field-label="starts_on">시작일</span><input type="date" name="starts_on"/></label><label><span data-field-label="ends_on">마감일 / 종료일</span><input type="date" name="ends_on"/></label></div></div>
<div data-project-fields class="kind-fields" hidden><label><span data-field-label="role_summary">내 역할</span><input name="role_summary" maxlength="500" placeholder="예: 게임 기획 · 전투 설계"/></label><div class="form-row"><label><span data-field-label="started_on">시작일</span><input type="date" name="started_on"/></label><label><span data-field-label="ended_on">종료일</span><input type="date" name="ended_on"/></label></div><label><span data-field-label="project_status">진행 상태</span><select name="project_status"><option value="planning">기획 중</option><option value="active">진행 중</option><option value="completed">완료</option><option value="paused">중단</option></select></label><label><span data-field-label="result_url">결과물 주소</span><input name="result_url" type="url" placeholder="https://"/></label><label><span data-field-label="team_up_id">연결할 Team Up</span><select name="team_up_id"><option value="">연결하지 않음</option></select></label></div>
<div class="cs-actions"><button class="button primary" type="submit" data-save>저장하기</button><a class="button secondary" href="/studio/">새로 작성</a><a class="text-link" data-view hidden>현재 글 보기 →</a></div></fieldset></form>
<section class="cs-section"><h2>내 작업 · 초안</h2><div class="cs-list" data-my-content></div></section><section class="cs-section"><h2>프로젝트 참여 요청</h2><p>내용을 확인하고 수락한 이력만 공개 포트폴리오에 표시됩니다.</p><div class="cs-list" data-invitations></div></section><script>import '../../lib/studio';</script></Base>
